<a href="#skills">Skills</a>
<a href="#opportunities">Opportunities</a>
<a href="#achievements">Achievements</a>

</nav>

<div class="profile">

<div>
<div class="level" id="levelText">LEVEL 1</div>
<small id="xpText">0 XP</small>
</div>

<div class="avatar">
P
</div>

</div>

</div>

</header>


<!-- =========================
HERO / DASHBOARD
========================= -->

<section class="hero" id="dashboard">

<div class="container">

<div class="hero-grid">

<div>

<span class="eyebrow">
Header</span>

<h1>
Stop Searching.
<span class="gradient-text">
Start Building.
</span>
</h1>

<p class="hero-copy">

PathKeeper turns career development into a visible progression system.
Discover opportunities, strengthen skills, build evidence, make better
decisions, and watch your professional momentum grow.

</p>

<div class="hero-actions">

<a href="#missions" class="btn btn-primary">
Begin Today's Mission
</a>

<a href="#skills" class="btn btn-dark">
View Skill Tree
</a>

</div>

</div>


<div class="command-panel card">

<div class="command-header">

<h3>Career Health</h3>

<span class="status">
● SYSTEM ACTIVE
</span>

</div>

<div class="score-ring" id="scoreRing">

<div class="score-value">

<strong id="careerScore">
42
</strong>

<span>CAREER SCORE</span>

</div>

</div>

<div class="score-label">
Building Momentum
