</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
STATS
========================= -->

<section class="stats">

<div class="container">

<div class="stat-grid">

<div class="stat">
<small>Current Level</small>
<strong id="levelStat">1</strong>
<span>Keep progressing</span>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<small>Total XP</small>
<strong id="xpStat">0</strong>
<span>Earn more</span>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<small>Streak</small>
<strong id="streakStat">1 🔥</strong>
<span>Consistency matters</span>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<small>Missions</small>
<strong id="missionStat">0</strong>
<span>Completed</span>
</div>

<div class="stat">
<small>Badges</small>
<strong id="badgeStat">0</strong>
<span>Unlocked</span>
</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
TODAY
========================= -->

<section class="today">

<div class="container">

<div class="section-heading">

<span class="eyebrow">
TODAY'S OPERATING PLAN
</span>

<h2>
Make Today Count.
