<span>
Find one realistic opportunity worth applying for.
</span>

<span class="reward">
+25
</span>

</label>

<label class="task">

<input type="checkbox" onchange="completeTask(this,30)">

<span>
Create or improve one piece of career evidence.
</span>

<span class="reward">
+30
</span>

</label>

<label class="task">

<input type="checkbox" onchange="completeTask(this,25)">

<span>
Spend 20 minutes practicing a valuable skill.
</span>

<span class="reward">
+25
</span>

</label>

</div>


<div class="focus-card card">

<span class="eyebrow">
FOCUS CAPACITY
</span>

