35%
</div>

<div class="focus-meter">
<div class="focus-fill"></div>
</div>

<p>
Protect your best attention for work that produces
skills, evidence, income, or opportunities.
</p>

<br>

<button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="focusBoost()">
Start Focus Session
</button>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- =========================
MISSIONS
========================= -->

<section class="missions" id="missions">

<div class="container">

<div class="section-heading center">

<span class="eyebrow">
MISSION BOARD
</span>

<h2>
Choose Your Next Move
</h2>

<p>
Different missions strengthen different parts of your career system.
Choose based on your current bottleneck.
</p>

</div>

<div class="mission-grid">


<div class="mission card">

<div class="mission-icon">🔍</div>

