<p>
Locate three opportunities aligned with your current skills and goals.
</p>

<button class="btn btn-dark" onclick="missionComplete(this,40)">
Complete Mission
</button>

<div class="mission-meta">
<span class="mission-xp">+40 XP</span>
<span class="difficulty">EASY</span>
</div>

</div>


<div class="mission card">

<div class="mission-icon">🧠</div>

<h3>Skill Upgrade</h3>

<p>
Spend focused time improving one skill that has real market value.
</p>

<button class="btn btn-dark" onclick="missionComplete(this,60)">
Complete Mission
</button>

<div class="mission-meta">
<span class="mission-xp">+60 XP</span>
<span class="difficulty">MEDIUM</span>
</div>

</div>


